1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:05,358
The Little Prince and Qiqi flew and flew, still on their way home.

2
00:00:05,308 --> 00:00:08,617
They passed by a very bright planet.

3
00:00:08,617 --> 00:00:11,985
There were so many sparkles everywhere.

4
00:00:11,985 --> 00:00:15,073
Wow, did the stars fall down?

5
00:00:15,073 --> 00:00:17,897
Qiqi opened her eyes wide.

6
00:00:17,897 --> 00:00:20,499
It wasn't stars at all.

7
00:00:20,499 --> 00:00:24,161
It was a man wearing very shiny clothes.

8
00:00:24,161 --> 00:00:27,294
With a super big hat on his head.

9
00:00:27,294 --> 00:00:30,676
The hat was so bright it was dazzling.

10
00:00:30,676 --> 00:00:32,367
Hello!

11
00:00:32,367 --> 00:00:34,529
Do I look handsome?

12
00:00:34,529 --> 00:00:37,117
The man kept asking.

13
00:00:37,117 --> 00:00:39,588
Yes, you do.

14
00:00:39,588 --> 00:00:42,647
The Little Prince answered politely.

15
00:00:42,647 --> 00:00:44,808
Then clap for me!

16
00:00:44,808 --> 00:00:47,029
More, more!

17
00:00:47,029 --> 00:00:49,867
The man shouted excitedly.

18
00:00:49,867 --> 00:00:53,617
Qiqi curiously tried on that big hat.

19
00:00:53,617 --> 00:00:57,970
When she put it on, a big mirror appeared in front of her.

20
00:00:57,970 --> 00:01:01,602
But... the mirror only showed herself.

21
00:01:01,602 --> 00:01:05,323
When Qiqi clapped, only she could hear it.

22
00:01:05,323 --> 00:01:10,073
When Qiqi said how beautiful, only she answered herself.

23
00:01:10,073 --> 00:01:13,205
Qiqi pouted and took the hat off.

24
00:01:13,205 --> 00:01:16,661
Praising yourself alone is so boring.

25
00:01:16,661 --> 00:01:20,735
The Little Prince thought and said: I have a rose.

26
00:01:20,735 --> 00:01:24,955
I praise her every day, and she praises me too.

27
00:01:24,955 --> 00:01:28,632
When you praise others, they'll praise you back.

28
00:01:28,632 --> 00:01:32,367
The man kept looking in the mirror endlessly.

29
00:01:32,367 --> 00:01:34,176
Praise me!

30
00:01:34,176 --> 00:01:35,985
Praise me!

31
00:01:35,985 --> 00:01:38,397
he shouted loudly.

32
00:01:38,397 --> 00:01:41,602
But nobody passed by this planet.

33
00:01:41,602 --> 00:01:47,808
Qiqi whispered to the Little Prince: Only looking at yourself... wouldn't that be lonely?

34
00:01:47,808 --> 00:01:50,235
The Little Prince nodded.

35
00:01:50,235 --> 00:01:53,647
They held hands and gently flew away.

36
00:01:53,647 --> 00:01:57,470
The man was still shouting: Do I look handsome?

37
00:01:57,470 --> 00:02:00,470
But nobody could hear him anymore.

38
00:02:00,470 --> 00:02:03,602
Kids, who do you like to praise?

39
00:02:03,602 --> 00:02:06,264
Go praise your best friend

